## Vendored upstream content

Files under `skills/agent-notes/` are vendored from
https://github.com/czm15053/write-notes-like-deepseek (MIT), by way of its
`skills/write-notes-like-deepseek/` directory. The pinned upstream ref and the
per-file SHA-256 digests are recorded in `upstream.json` and
`tools/upstream-manifest.json`.

That project states it distills engineering practice from DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), whose `.agents/notes/`
documentation is the origin of the classification and archival rules.

Upstream content is redistributed here unmodified; verify with
`node tools/verify-plugin.mjs`, which compares every vendored file against the
recorded digest.
